      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-induced features provide additional slip systems that increase room-temperature plasticity.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Interfaces created by the Cr-induced microstructure trap irradiation-induced defects and mitigate defect accumulation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The predominantly BCC matrix will maintain high-temperature mechanical performance despite the Cr-induced features.",
